      "notes": [
        "Ordinary printed nonnegative integral loyalty is compiled from the canonical Planeswalker card type and enters through a mandatory self-replacement and nested counter event.",
        "Represented competing quantity replacements use affected-controller ordering; simultaneous entries prepare in APNAP order and a resolving permanent can suspend and replay exactly.",
